{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115831388931018752"]}, "author_id": "1131442257675083777", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:41:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115831392693342247"], "id": "2115831392693342247", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 140, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115831375991619676", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "普通人以后从哪里进去？计划中的一个入口叫 OKXICE，是 OKX 和 ICE 的合资公司。通过它提供这些合约，也要等相关审批。\n\n如果美股盘后出了消息，24/7 合约可能让人先表达价格判断；\n当然，休市时价格和流动性可能变化，杠杆也会放大亏损。 https://t.co/KXp8Ks7B3L", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115831392693342247"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115831371893800960"]}, "author_id": "1131442257675083777", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:41:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115831375991619676"], "id": "2115831375991619676", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 133, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115831358509748441", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "ICE 又是来做什么的？\n\nICE 是纽交所的母公司。它计划运营这个美国新市场，建立独立的交易和清算结构，配上身份核验、保证金和风险管理等环节。\n\n可以把清算理解成：\n交易撮合之后，还得有人按规则管理双方的履约风险。\n\n新结构仍要获得监管批准！ https://t.co/3omYv8czyU", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115831375991619676"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115831355296878592"]}, "author_id": "1131442257675083777", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:41:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115831358509748441"], "id": "2115831358509748441", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115831341946429583", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Hyperliquid 和 Trade[XYZ] 又分别做什么？\n\n可以想成一间交易工坊：\nHyperliquid 提供链上的订单簿和保证金系统；\nTrade[XYZ] 在上面设计并运营自己的市场，决定合约规则和参考价格。\n\n它现在已有面向美国以外合资格用户的市场。\n\n美国计划会采用 Hyperliquid 技术，另外建立受监管的市场和清算结构。 https://t.co/ny3Cg1tyKc", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115831358509748441"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115831338792308736"]}, "author_id": "1131442257675083777", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:41:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115831341946429583"], "id": "2115831341946429583", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 75, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115831325035036786", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "永续合约是买股票吗？\n\n不是。比如一份跟某只股票价格有关的合约，你参与的是价格涨跌，没有拿到公司股票。它也没有固定到期日。\n\n价格如果偏离参考价格，资金费率会让多空中的一方向另一方定期支付，给价格往回靠的动力。\n\n具体谁付给谁，要看当期费率；持仓还有费用和亏损风险。 https://t.co/Bjnl0N5k23", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115831341946429583"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115831320878419968"]}, "author_id": "1131442257675083777", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:41:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115831325035036786"], "id": "2115831325035036786", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1274, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115777773545664533", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "ICE、Trade[XYZ]、Hyperliquid、OKXICE……这一堆名字到底在讲什么？\n\n首先恭喜 OKX，OKXICE 在美国永续市场的布局又有了新进展！🎉\n\n假如有位 Web3 萌新问我，我会先拿出这张图：\n\n有人搭交易系统，有人设计合约，有人负责市场和清算，还有人连接用户。\n\n接下来拆开聊👇 https://t.co/9crdGzxYkb https://t.co/5HVjucgm2E", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115831325035036786"}, {"author_id": "1131442257675083777", "created_at": "2026-10-29T08:56:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115729520112345423"], "id": "2115729520112345423", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 45087, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115701730742808811", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "卧槽，现在已经这样了吗。。。 https://t.co/UY0kxZZOAq", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115729520112345423"}, {"author_id": "1131442257675083777", "created_at": "2026-10-29T05:29:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115677390521479620"], "id": "2115677390521479620", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 941, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115676645092942247", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "哈哈哈哈 那剧情可能就是：\n\nCook：什么？你要搞触摸屏？要不这个 CEO 你来当？🐶 https://t.co/IpwY0BLc5l", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115677390521479620"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115676737397022720"]}, "author_id": "1131442257675083777", "created_at": "2026-10-29T05:27:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115676985209000328"], "id": "2115676985209000328", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1055, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115639339887829318", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "不会 过几年出来 MBP 版本 折叠屏 吧？？！\n\n先让屏幕支持触摸，再慢慢把键盘变成屏幕。\n一半用来显示内容，一半随时切换成虚拟键盘。\n再往后，语音输入、甚至意念输入越来越方便，键盘也许就不再是必需品了。\n最后展开，就是一块大屏幕。\n\n收起来，像一台放大版的 iPhone Duo... https://t.co/BHvXnvI5Eg https://t.co/QHcRzDyyys", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115676985209000328"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2115831388931018752", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115831371893800960", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115831355296878592", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115831338792308736", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115831320878419968", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115676737397022720", "type": "photo"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2115831392693342247", "oldest_id": "2115676985209000328", "previous_token": "77qpymm88g5h9vqkmfprnnnsvmuoh38it7i1ps33yovnb", "result_count": 8}}